MPN.W64.Config.parseDC","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/862f63d87fc6e56d648eb33296f1cf7ff688fd89/MPN64/Config.lean#L114-L114"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN64/Config.html#MPN.W64.Config.strDC\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">W64</span>.<span class=\"name\">Config</span>.<span class=\"name\">strDC</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./MPN64/Config.html#MPN.W64.Config\">Config</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The size from which decimal strings are written by divide and conquer.","docLink":"./MPN64/Config.html#MPN.W64.Config.strDC","kind":"def","line":109,"name":"MPN.W64.Config.strDC","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/862f63d87fc6e56d648eb33296f1cf7ff688fd89/MPN64/Config.lean#L109-L109"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN64/Config.html#MPN.W64.Config.gcdHalf\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">W64</span>.<span class=\"name\">Config</span>.<span class=\"name\">gcdHalf</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./MPN64/Config.html#MPN.W64.Config\">Config</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The size of the smaller number from which the greatest common divisor uses half-gcd.","docLink":"./MPN64/Config.html#MPN.W64.Config.gcdHalf","kind":"def","line":107,"name":"MPN.W64.Config.gcdHalf","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/862f63d87fc6e56d648eb33296f1cf7ff688fd89/MPN64/Config.lean#L107-L107"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN64/Config.html#MPN.W64.Config.sqrtRemRenorm\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">W64</span>.<span class=\"name\">Config</span>.<span class=\"name\">sqrtRemRenorm</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./MPN64/Config.html#MPN.W64.Config\">Config</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The size of the root, in limbs, from which the square root with its remainder takes the remainder\nof Zimmermann's recursion, renormalized by a product by a word, instead of `x - s²`, when the\noperand needs a shift (`Bridge.sqrtRemZ`); as measured on Zen 3, where the passes of the\nrenormalization cost more than the square below it.","docLink":"./MPN64/Config.html#MPN.W64.Config.sqrtRemRenorm","kind":"def","line":105,"name":"MPN.W64.Config.sqrtRemRenorm","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/862f63d87fc6e56d648eb33296f1cf7ff688fd89/MPN64/Config.lean#L105-L105"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN64/Config.html#MPN.W64.Config.div2Rows\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">W64</span>.<span class=\"name\">Config</span>.<span class=\"name\">div2Rows</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./MPN64/Config.html#MPN.W64.Config\">Config</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The size of the divisor from which schoolbook division takes two quotient limbs per pass, by one\nmultiply-subtract pass with two rows (`Schoolbook.divLoop2In`), as measured on Zen 3: below it,\nthe fixed cost of the two-limb estimate outweighs the pass it saves.","docLink":"./MPN64/Config.html#MPN.W64.Config.div2Rows","kind":"def","line":96,"name":"MPN.W64.Config.div2Rows","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/862f63d87fc6e56d648eb33296f1cf7ff688fd89/MPN64/Config.lean#L96-L96"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN64/Config.html#MPN.W64.Config.div32Recip\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">W64</span>.<span class=\"name\">Config</span>.<span class=\"name\">div32Recip</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./MPN64/Config.html#MPN.W64.Config\">Config</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The size of the divisor from which schoolbook division estimates the quotient limbs by GMP's\n3-by-2 step with a precomputed reciprocal instead of the hardware divider: always, like GMP's\n`mpn_sbpi1_div_qr`.","docLink":"./MPN64/Config.html#MPN.W64.Config.div32Recip","kind":"def","line":90,"name":"MPN.W64.Config.div32Recip","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/862f63d87fc6e56d648eb33296f1cf7ff688fd89/MPN64/Config.lean#L90-L90"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN64/Config.html#MPN.W64.Config.div1Unnorm\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">W64</span>.<span class=\"name\">Config</span>.<span class=\"name\">div1Unnorm</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./MPN64/Config.html#MPN.W64.Config\">Config</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The size from which division by an unnormalized limb takes the steps with a precomputed\nreciprocal of the divisor normalized by a shift, with the dividend shifted, instead of the\nhardware divider: always, like GMP's `mpn_divrem_1`.","docLink":"./MPN64/Config.html#MPN.W64.Config.div1Unnorm","kind":"def","line":84,"name":"MPN.W64.Config.div1Unnorm","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/862f63d87fc6e56d648eb33296f1cf7ff688fd89/MPN64/Config.lean#L84-L84"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN64/Config.html#MPN.W64.Config.div1Recip\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">W64</span>.<span class=\"name\">Config</span>.<span class=\"name\">div1Recip</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./MPN64/Config.html#MPN.W64.Config\">Config</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The size from which division by a normalized limb takes Möller and Granlund's steps with a\nprecomputed reciprocal instead of the hardware divider: always, like GMP's `mpn_divrem_1`.","docLink":"./MPN64/Config.html#MPN.W64.Config.div1Recip","kind":"def","line":78,"name":"MPN.W64.Config.div1Recip","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/862f63d87fc6e56d648eb33296f1cf7ff688fd89/MPN64/Config.lean#L78-L78"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN64/Config.html#MPN.W64.Config.toDivConfig\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">W64</span>.<span class=\"name\">Config</span>.<span class=\"name\">toDivConfig</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./MPN64/Config.html#MPN.W64.C